study (optimized on protecting group, stoichiometry, solvent, temp and
time)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Uncatalyzed, Diastereoselective Vinylogous Mukaiyama Aldol Reactions on
Aqueous Media: Pyrrole vs Furan 2-Silyloxy Dienes
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
