$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. k)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-(2-chlorophenyl)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9l) yield: 73%, reaction time: 9d, ee: 75%. [α]D24 = -38.7° (c = 1.03,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(300 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.54 (m, 4 H, H18, H19), 1.62
(m, 2 H, H18'), 2.60 (m, 1 H, H4a), 2.78 (m, 1 H, H4b), 3.38 (m, 2 H,
H17), 3.57 (m, 2 H, H17'), 3.67 (s, 3 H, H16), 3.90 (br s, 1 H, NH), 4.89
(m, 1 H, H5), 6.32 (d, J = 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.40 (m, 2 H, H13), 6.66
(m, 2 H, H14), 6.78 (td, J = 7.0, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.17 (m, 2 H, H7,
H9), 7.36 (m, 1 H, H8), 7.43 (m, 1 H, H10). 13C-NMR(75 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C):
d = 25.50 (C19), 25.44 (C18), 26.57 (C18'), 39.04 (C4), 42.99 (C17),
46.83 (C17'), 54.27 (C5), 55.57 (C16), 114.6 (C13), 114.7 (C14), 123.9
(C2), 127.2 (C8), 127.6 (C9), 128.2 (C7), 129.7 (C10), 132.6 (C11), 139.7
(C12), 140.0 (C3), 140.5 (C6), 152.2 (C15), 164.8 (C1). IR (Film): ν
(cm-1) = 3338, 3062, 2997, 2938, 2856, 2831, 1656, 1608, 1512, 1441,
1353, 1238, 1180, 1139, 1101, 1035, 975, 852, 819, 787, 760, 712, 548. UV
(MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 213 (4.393), 244 (4.239), 312 (3.399). HR-MS
(ESI): calcd. for C23H28ClN2O2 ([M+H]+): 399,18338; found: 399.18360.
calcd. for C23H27ClN2O2Na ([M+Na]+): 421,16533; found: 421.16551. calcd.
for C46H55Cl2N4O4 ([2M+H]+): 797,35949; found: 797.36100. calcd. for
C46H54Cl2N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+): 819,34143; found: 819.34121. HPLC: Chiralcel
column, solvent: n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1, flow rate: 1.0 ml/min,
UVdetection at 250 nm, major enantiomer tr = 9.7 min (9l), minor
enantiomer tr = 15.1 min (ent- 9l).
