$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. f)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-(4-chlorophenyl)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9g) yield: 73%, reaction time: 9d, ee: 80%. [α]D24 = +15.7° (c = 1.02,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(300 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.53 (m, 4 H, H16, H17), 1.62
(m, 2 H, H16'), 2.68 (dd, J = 7.0, 7.0 Hz, 2 H, H4), 3.35 (m, 2 H, H15),
3.56 (m, 2 H, H15'), 3.68 (s, 3 H, H14), 4.06 (br s, 1 H, NH), 4.39 (m, 1
H, H5), 6.24 (d, J = 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.46 (m, 2 H, H11), 6.67 (m, 2 H,
H12), 6.70 (td, J = 7.0, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.28 (m, 4 H, H7, H8).
13C-NMR(75 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 24.50 (C17), 25.45 (C16), 26.58 (C16'),
41.17 (C4), 43.02 (C15), 46.84 (C15'), 55.61 (C14), 57.77 (C5), 114.7
(C11), 115.3 (C12), 124.1 (C2), 127.9 (C7), 128.8 (C8), 132.8 (C9), 139.8
(C3), 140.1 (C6), 141.2 (C10), 152.6 (C13), 164.7 (C1). IR (Film): ν
(cm-1) = 3336, 2998, 2938, 2856, 1726, 1657, 1610, 1512, 1489, 1440,
1352, 1238, 1180, 1139, 1125, 1091, 1040, 1015, 976, 877, 820, 786, 532.
UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 222 (4.573), 243 (4.436), 312 (3.594). HR-MS
(ESI): calcd. for C23H28ClN2O2 ([M+H]+): 399,18338; found: 399.18380.
calcd. for C23H27ClN2O2Na ([M+Na]+): 421,16533; found: 421.16552. calcd.
for C46H55Cl2N4O4 ([2M+H]+): 797,35949; found: 797.36122. calcd. for
C46H54Cl2N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+): 819,34143; found: 819.34152. HPLC: Chiralcel
OD column, solvent: n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1, flow rate: 1.0 ml/min,
UVdetection at 250 nm, major enantiomer tr = 17.0 min (9g), minor
enantiomer tr = 31.1 min (ent-9g).
