$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. l)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)-5-(thiophen-3-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9m) yield: 72%, reaction time: 9d, ee: 86%. [α]D24 = +12.9° (c = 1.09,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(300 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.53 (m, 4 H, H16, H17), 1.62
(m, 2 H, H16'), 2.75 (dd, J = 6.5 Hz, 7.0 Hz, 2 H, H4), 3.36 (m, 2 H,
H15), 3.56 (m, 2 H, H15'), 3.70 (s, 3 H, H14), 3.97 (br s, 1 H, NH), 4.56
(t, J = 6.5 Hz, 1 H, H5), 6.25 (d, J = 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.54 (m, 2 H,
H11), 6.71 (m, 2 H, H12), 6.72 (td, J = 7.0, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.05 (dd,
J = 1.0 Hz, 5.0 Hz, 1 H, H7), 7.13 (m, 1 H, H9), 7.26 (m, 1 H, H8).
13C-NMR(75 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 24.52 (C17), 25.46 (C16), 26.60 (C16'),
39.87 (C4), 42.99 (C15), 46.83 (C15'), 54.34 (C5), 55.64 (C14), 114.7
(C11), 115.4 (C12), 121.3 (C9), 123.9 (C2), 126.0 (C8), 126.1 (C7), 140.1
(C3), 140.5 (C10), 143.9 (C6), 152.5 (C13), 164.9 (C1). IR (Film): ν
(cm-1) = 3333, 2997, 2937, 2856, 1728, 1657, 1610, 1512, 1441, 1367,
1351, 1237, 1180, 1139, 1124, 1094, 1039, 976, 852, 820, 787, 762, 687,
657, 521. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 203 (4.312), 206 (4.293), 241
(4.140), 312 (3.279). HR-MS (ESI): calcd. for C21H27N2O2S ([M+H]+):
371,17878; found: 371.17909. calcd. for C21H26N2O2SNa ([M+Na]+):
393,16072; found: 393.16099. calcd. for C42H53N4O4S2 ([2M+H]+):
741,35027; found: 741.35047. calcd. for C42H52N4O4S2Na ([2M+Na]+):
763,33222; found: 763.33237. HPLC: Chiralcel OD column, solvent:
n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1, flow rate: 1.0 ml/min, UVdetection at 250 nm,
major enantiomer tr = 18.3 min (9m), minor enantiomer tr = 26.9 min
(ent-9m).
