$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. m)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-(furan-3-yl)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9n) yield: 72%, reaction time: 9d, ee: 84%. [α]D24 = -7.4° (c = 1.08,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(300 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.54 (m, 4 H, H16, H17), 1.62
(m, 2 H, H16'), 2.71 (m, 2 H, H4), 3.38 (m, 2 H, H15), 3.57 (m, 2 H,
H15'), 3.72 (s, 3 H, H14), 4.46 (t, J = 6.0 Hz, 1 H, H5), 6.28 (d, J =
15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.37 (m, 1 H, H7), 6.59 (m, 2 H, H11), 6.73 (m, 2 H,
H12), 6.74 (td, J = 7.5, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.32 (m, 1 H, H9), 7.35 (m, 1
H, H8). 13C-NMR(75 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 24.53 (C17), 25.47 (C16), 26.59
(C16'), 38.97 (C4), 43.02 (C15), 46.83 (C15'), 50.55 (C5), 55.66 (C14),
109.0 (C7), 114.7 (C11), 115.6 (C12), 123.9 (C2), 126.9 (C6), 139.7 (C9),
140.3 (C3), 140.3 (C10), 143.3 (C8), 152.7 (C13), 164.9 (C1). IR (Film):
ν (cm-1) = 3337, 2938, 2856, 1720, 1658, 1614, 1512, 1441, 1238, 1180,
1161, 1139, 1124, 1024, 875, 786, 762, 601. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) =
206 (4.365), 245 (4.096), 313 (3.273). HR-MS (ESI): calcd. for C21H27N2O3
([M+H]+): 355,20162; found: 355.20166. calcd. for C42H53N4O6 ([2M+H]+):
709,39596; found: 709.39648. HPLC: Chiralcel OD column, solvent:
n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1, flow rate 1.0 ml/min, UVdetection at 250 nm,
major enantiomer tr = 15.8 min (9n), minor enantiomer tr = 22.7 min
(ent-9n).
