Vinylketene Silyl N,O-Acetals
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Giera, David S.; Sickert, Marcel; Schneider, Christoph
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2008), 10(19), 4259-4262

