(2R,3R)-3-Hydroxy-2-methyl-1,3-diphenylpropan-1-one (3a). Yield 8.0 mg,
93%. The configuration of the product was determined as 2R,3R using a
Chiralcel OJ-H column by comparison with the retention order of authentic
compounds on a Chiralcel OJ column.12 TLC Rf = 0.20 (10:1 hexanes/ethyl
acetate); HPLC (Chiralpak AS-H, isocratic 9:1 hexanes/2-propanol,flow
rate 1.0 mL/min, λ= 254 nm) 96:4 er; 36:1syn:anti; tR= 8.02 min (major,
