(X mol %) and Nd(OTf)3 (20 mol %), which was stirred at 50 °C for 2 h and
then cooled to -25 °C, were added
(Z)-trimethyl(1-phenylprop-1-enyloxy)silane (48.8μmol, 1.5 equiv) and
benzaldehyde (32.5μmol, 1.0 equiv).
(syn)-3-Hydroxy-2-methyl-3-phenyl-1-(p-tolyl)propan-1-one (3l). Yield 7.4
mg, 89%: The configuration of the product was determined as syn by
comparison with the 1H NMR spectra of authentic compounds.24 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3 , δ ) 7.87-7.84 (m, 2H), 7.43-7.34 (m, 4H), 7.29-7.25 (m, 3H),
5.25 (t,J= 2.4 Hz, 1H), 3.77 (d,J= 1.6 Hz, 1H), 3.72-3.64 (m, 1H), 2.43
