126.3 (CH), 73.2 (CH), 47.0 (CH), 21.9 (CH3 ), 11.3 (CH3); TLC Rf = 0.20
(10:1 hexanes/ethyl acetate); HRESIMS (m/z) [M + Na]+ calcd for
C17H18O2Na, 277.1204; found, 277.1196; HPLC (Chiralpak AD-H, isocratic
90:10 n-heptane/2-propanol, flow rate 0.8 mL/min, λ= 254 nm) 96:4 er;
30:1 syn:anti; tR= 12.36 min (major,syn), 15.95 min (minor,syn), 23.69
min (minor,anti), 30.30 min (major,anti).
