(X mol %) and Nd(OTf)3 (20 mol %), which was stirred at 50 °C for 2 h and
then cooled to -25 °C, were added
(Z)-trimethyl(1-phenylprop-1-enyloxy)silane (48.8μmol, 1.5 equiv) and
benzaldehyde (32.5μmol, 1.0 equiv).
(syn)-1-(4-Chlorophenyl)-3-hydroxy-2-methyl-3-phenylpropan-1-one
(3k).Yield 8.1 mg, 90%: The configuration of the product was determined
as syn by comparison with the 1H NMR spectra of authentic compounds.24 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3 , δ ) 7.88-7.85 (m, 2H), 7.46-7.44 (m, 2H), 7.41-7.33
(m, 4H), 7.30- 7.25 (m, 1H), 5.23 (t,J= 2.4 Hz, 1H), 3.69-3.62 (m, 1H),
