204.6, 141.9, 140.3, 134.2, 130.1 (CH), 129.3 (CH), 128.5 (CH), 127.7
(CH), 126.2 (CH), 73.4 (CH), 47.4 (CH), 11.6 (CH3); TLC Rf = 0.20 (10:1
hexanes/ethyl acetate); HRESIMS (m/z) [M + Na]+ calcd for C16H15O2ClNa,
297.0658; found, 297.0660; HPLC (Chiralpak AD-H, isocratic 90:10
n-heptane/2-propanol, flow rate 0.8 mL/min, λ = 254 nm) 96:4 er; 15:1
syn:anti; tR = 14.59 min (major,syn), 19.60 min (minor,syn), 18.03 min
(minor,anti), 32.93 min (major,anti). ,
