= 89.0 Hz, 2H), 3.97 (m, 1H), 3.82 (m, 1H), 3.78 (s, 3H), 3.67 (OH, bs,
1H), 3.53 (m, 2H), 2.31 (dd, J = 7.9, 14.5 Hz, 1H), 2.23 (dd, J = 4.8,
