found 493.3; [α]D 21= +6.3º (c=1.0, THF). Alcohol 12a: 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 7.35-7.26 (m, 5H), 7.19 (d, J = 8.6 Hz, 2H), 6.84 (d, J = 8.6
Hz, 2H), 5.25 (s, 1H), 4.46 (ABq, J AB = 11.9 Hz, ΔνAB = 8.3 Hz, 2H),
